# Nexxo Smart Contract Audit Reports

## Overview

This folder contains historical public smart contract audit materials completed by Softstack for Nexxo.

Nexxo is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a token smart contract security reference. The folder contains separate historical materials from 2019 and 2020.

## Audit Information

Project: Nexxo  
Audit type: Token smart contract audit and certificate  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in nested folders  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

